Package: catpalettes
Title: Colour Palette Selection for Categorical Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Shanjie", "Jiao",
           email = "",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Luna", "Zhang",
            email = "",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Tallinn", "Splinter",
            email = "tallinn.splinter@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: A toolkit for colouring categorical data. Provides tools
    for finding palettes with enough colours, assigning colours to
    categories, and creating related shades for categories within groups.
    Supports existing parent colours or automatically generated group
    colours, with grayscale and colour vision deficiency previews.
    Also includes tools for assessing colour separation and exporting
    category-colour mappings.
